      "id": 91712,
      "name": "JimmytheRat",
      "username": "JimmytheRat",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-15T22:04:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Combat Stance (or anything else that triggers off of damage) will only activate if the hitpoint value actually changed.&nbsp; If an attack can't get through the damage reduction or is redirected away to another target, damage wasn't actually dealt to Wraith.</p><p>EDIT: Accursed ninja!</p>",
