      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"elias4444\"]\n\nQuick clarification needed here:When Wraith has her Combat Stance in play and uses her Stealth power...If someone hits her for two or less points of damage (being reduced to 0 by her Stealth power), does she still get to trigger Combat Stance and deal 2 melee damage to that target?&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nNo. If a card says &quot;When X takes damage...&quot; they have to actually take the damage. This would also apply to Ra taking fire damage with Flesh of the Sun God out, for example. If no hit points are lost, the effects aren&#39;t triggered.\n",
